OL,3,GNEWSARecord 35,000 take part in Great
OL,4,AScottish Run through Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA record number of 35,000 people have
OL,7,Ftaken part in this year's Great
OL,8,FScottish Run through the streets of
OL,9,FGlasgow.
OL,11,FFun-running adults and children joined
OL,12,Felite athletes to take part in a
OL,13,Fweekend of events which kicked off on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FSunday's runs included a 10k and a half
OL,17,Fmarathon, with Scotland's 2022
OL,18,FCommonwealth Games gold medallist
OL,19,FEilish McColgan and charity fundraiser
OL,20,FCraig Ferguson the official starters.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
